harness/runs/
agent/mem_store/
*.log

# Local probe-and-draft output (keep local; the curated reports stay tracked)
docs/enhancements/*-enhancement-scan.md
docs/bug-reports/*-daily-hunt.md

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
